## iboxreplica SYNC examples

edit and create these to test iboxreplica controller logic, these examples 
are for SYNC replication type.  You can create a replica based on a VOLUME, 
CG, or FILESYSTEM using SYNC replication type.

The 'local_entity-name' is the PV (volume) name that you want to replicate.

The 'link_remote_system_name' has to be looked up using the Ibox API 
(get links) call.  This is the name given to the link, not always the 
same as the remote ibox host name.
